/compile_commands.json

# In-source build artifacts that land under nested directories when CMake
# (or autoconf, in masstree's case) is run with the source tree as the
# build dir. The canonical build dir is /build; these wildcard rules guard
# against accidental in-source builds polluting `git status` / `git add -A`.
